---
import { products, offerPath } from '../../data/store';
---
<section class="source-section" id="source"><div class="shell source-layout">
  <div><p class="eyebrow">For the “I could build that” crowd</p><h2>Have a different idea?<br/><span class="serif">Start with the source.</span></h2><p class="source-copy">You probably could build it. That’s why the code is part of the offer. Get a working starting point, make your changes, and take it somewhere else.</p><div class="source-facts"><span>SwiftUI + AppKit</span><span>No external packages</span><span>App included</span></div><div class="actions"><a class="text-link" href={offerPath('wisp','source')}>Wisp source · ${products.wisp.sourcePrice} ↗</a><a class="text-link" href={offerPath('perch','source')}>Perch source · ${products.perch.sourcePrice} ↗</a></div><p class="fine">Planned packages include the editable project and build instructions.<br/>Commercial use and redistribution terms will be published before sale.</p></div>
  <div class="source-window"><div class="source-window-bar"><span aria-hidden="true">● ● ●</span><span>something-you-can-make-yours/</span></div><div class="source-files"><div><span>⌄</span><b> Wisp/</b><small>the actual project structure</small></div><p>├─ Sources/</p><p>│ &nbsp;├─ Wisp/ <em>the native app</em></p><p>│ &nbsp;└─ WispCore/ <em>the core logic</em></p><p>├─ Tests/</p><p>├─ scripts/</p><p>└─ Package.swift</p></div><div class="source-window-foot"><span class="code-braces">{ '{ }' }</span><p>A head start.<br/><b>With room for your ideas.</b></p><span class="source-arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span></div></div>
</div></section>
<style>
.source-section{background:#edf1e8;border-block:1px solid #dce3d4;padding:75px 0}.source-layout{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.2fr 1fr;gap:85px;align-items:center}.source-layout h2{margin:21px 0;font-size:clamp(32px,3.7vw,46px)}.source-copy{font-size:16px;color:var(--muted);max-width:460px}.source-facts{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:12px;margin:24px 0;font:10px var(--mono);color:#52634e}.source-facts>span:before{content:'✓';margin-right:6px}.source-layout .actions{gap:25px;margin:28px 0 22px}.source-layout .fine{font-size:11px}.source-window{border:1px solid #d2dccb;background:#fafcf7;border-radius:13px;box-shadow:0 16px 32px #45553c0b;transform:rotate(2deg)}.source-window-bar{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:18px;font:9px var(--mono);color:#77836e;padding:18px;border-bottom:1px solid #e1e8d9}.source-window-bar>span:first-child{letter-spacing:2px;color:#c4cebc}.source-files{padding:26px;font:12px/2 var(--mono);color:#5b6954}.source-files>div{margin-bottom:17px}.source-files b{color:#31412d;font-weight:550}.source-files small{display:block;font-size:9px;margin-left:19px;color:#798671}.source-files p{line-height:2.4}.source-files em{font:9px var(--mono);color:#7b8775;margin-left:10px}.source-window-foot{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:18px;padding:22px 26px;border-top:1px solid #e1e8d9}.code-braces{font:25px var(--mono);color:#6c855d}.source-window-foot p{font-size:12px;color:#73806b}.source-window-foot b{font-weight:500;color:#3d5135}.source-arrow{margin-left:auto;font-size:30px;color:#829676}
@media(max-width:760px){.source-section{padding:50px 0}.source-layout{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:38px}.source-window{transform:none}.source-files{padding:22px}.source-window-bar{font-size:8px}.source-layout .actions{gap:20px}.source-copy{font-size:15px}}
</style>
